{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"customer-acquisition-cost-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"customer-acquisition-cost-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["customer-acquisition-cost-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Menghitung biaya dan pelanggan dari periode yang sama dan skop aksesi. CAC adalah rata-rata campuran, bukan CAC marginal atau bukti bahwa sebuah kampanye menyebabkan setiap penjualan. Payback menggunakan pendapatan × marjin bruto sebagai perkiraan keuntungan bruto bulanan sederhana; tidak termasuk churn, waktu pembayaran, pajak, overhead dan perubahan kelompok pelanggan. Bukan nasihat keuangan.","record_id":"41e274f2606db186565d11014ee5ef7957b0e15e73c37768c1834d15203341ef","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.3018820638749844,"source":"Count costs and customers from the same period and acquisition scope. CAC is a blended average, not marginal CAC or proof that a campaign caused each sale. Payback uses revenue × gross margin as a simple monthly gross-profit estimate; it excludes churn, payment timing, taxes, overhead and changing customer cohorts. Not financial advice.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"de0b7da85b2dffb15d66079c047738bf004714d2b5d708c63411072962b4c46b","status":"needs-review","translation":"Menghitung biaya dan pelanggan dari periode yang sama dan skop aksesi. CAC adalah rata-rata campuran, bukan CAC marginal atau bukti bahwa sebuah kampanye menyebabkan setiap penjualan. Payback menggunakan pendapatan × marjin bruto sebagai perkiraan keuntungan bruto bulanan sederhana; tidak termasuk churn, waktu pembayaran, pajak, overhead dan perubahan kelompok pelanggan. Bukan nasihat keuangan.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"density-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"density-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","keys":["density-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Masukkan massa dan volume masing-masing komponen pada barisnya sendiri. Alat ini membagi massa total dengan volume total dan mengasumsikan bahwa volume komponen adalah aditif. Campuran nyata dapat mengecil, mengembang, larut atau mengandung kekosongan, sehingga volume akhir yang diukur lebih akurat ketika itu penting.","record_id":"414b4c73d977a0d5374a03c519eee602bc5c238abb0dfaf12937dfffe220db35","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.4295152602500139,"source":"Enter each component’s mass and volume on its own line. The tool divides total mass by total volume and assumes the component volumes are additive. Real mixtures may shrink, expand, dissolve or contain voids, so measured final volume is more accurate when that matters.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"25ccd26c48b5799c491ef1e6d713a516262e5f868a5ee18a9aa003fc5b646eb3","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Masukkan massa dan volume masing-masing komponen pada barisnya sendiri. Alat ini membagi massa total dengan volume total dan mengasumsikan bahwa volume komponen adalah aditif. Campuran nyata dapat mengecil, mengembang, larut atau mengandung kekosongan, sehingga volume akhir yang diukur lebih akurat ketika itu penting.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
